    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36646" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξᾰλέομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beware of, avoid, escape,</i>
			
