				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.586
				</span></i>
			; mostly in 
				Ep.
			
			aor. 1
			inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς νόον ἐξαλέασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					105
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
