				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1080
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάων οὔτινά φημι διαμπερὲς ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.319
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.466
			</span></i>: pres.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαλέονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					2.385
				</span></i>
			.—
				Ep.
			 word, cf. sq.</div>
